<PolicyPage title="Accessibility - Love Mallacoota" description="Love Mallacoota's accessibility commitment and feedback process." canonicalPath="/accessibility.html" prefix="Access for" accent="Everyone" lede="The site is being built toward WCAG 2.1 AA and for practical use on older devices and slower connections.">
  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>We aim for readable type, strong contrast, keyboard access, useful link text, labelled controls, reduced-motion support and layouts that work from small phones to large screens.</p>
  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>Third-party embeds such as maps, video, calendars and advertising are not fully controlled by us. Historical archive PDFs may need remediation or an accessible text alternative before public release.</p>
  <h2>Request an alternative</h2>
  <p>If information is difficult to use, <a href="/contact.html">tell us which page and what you need</a>. We will provide the information in a practical alternative format where possible and use the report to improve the site.</p>
</PolicyPage>
